title: Coalition Meeting
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: coalition_meeting_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; coalition_meeting_timer = 3

= Coalition Meeting

Settle a shared priority without pretending the Front is a disciplined party.

- @meeting_constitution: Reaffirm the narrow constitutional program
- @meeting_dissent: Hear dissent before fixing the agenda
- @meeting_oil: Put oil coordination on the agenda

@meeting_constitution
on-arrival: iran_party_relation += 4; independent_nationalists_relation += 3; toilers_dissent += 1; constitutional_legitimacy += 2
go-to: post_event

@meeting_dissent
on-arrival: toilers_relation += 3; religious_network_relation += 3; iran_party_dissent -= 2; independent_nationalists_dissent -= 2; political_intelligence += 2
go-to: post_event

@meeting_oil
on-arrival: independent_nationalists_relation += 4; religious_network_relation += 2; oil_coalition_support += 3
go-to: post_event
